From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx9_36 meshes, effects, files, texture shaders; d3dxof template copy (3640)

d3dx9_36: meshes (OptimizeFaces/Vertices, OptimizeInplace vertex cache and strip reorder, single strip, N-patches, CleanMesh, blended and indexed blended meshes), effects (function queries, SetArrayRange, ValidateTechnique device check), files (CreateSaveObject, GetEnum, RegisterEnumTemplates with a Wine private d3dxof interface, FROMWFILE), texture shaders (constants through the constant table and a parameter store, FillVolumeTextureTX; todo_wine of the Windows-verified test removed) and the empty-state members of the fragment linker. See patches/notes/3640.txt.
